{"w":2400,"lines":[{"x":0.7716049391467531,"c":0.5,"y":0.046511627815394085,"t":"1718867188","h":0.008720930389296444,"w":0.069958845774332645},{"w":0.3374485524495443,"h":0.018929588219021354,"c":1,"x":0.10082304877458886,"y":0.097383721316210314,"t":"TEST 3, WRITING TASK 2"},{"x":0.10082305614265726,"w":0.65020573933919268,"y":0.13221436958310706,"h":0.014723203769140158,"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 6.5 score.","c":1},{"h":0.018922740635237245,"c":1,"y":0.1569493519921864,"x":0.10082303575124664,"t":"As the number of professionals workking abroad increases, it is often discussed whether they","w":0.72839508056640623},{"c":1,"t":"should stay where hey did their trainings or they should be free to move to another country if they","h":0.018972388987546829,"w":0.77572016398111987,"y":0.17579505247826899,"x":0.10082304547918644},{"w":0.74485595703125007,"c":1,"t":"desired to. While I believe theat a person should be free to migrate, I agree that it has negative","h":0.019140164899882239,"x":0.10082305028606024,"y":0.19464075407801629},{"c":1,"y":0.21511627890333918,"w":0.26543210347493484,"h":0.017510340547954861,"t":"effects on the country of training.","x":0.1008230427767072},{"h":0.017667844522968101,"y":0.24116607773616527,"t":"On the one hand, professionals who decide to work abroad are seeking for a different lifestyle and","c":1,"x":0.10082303825733827,"w":0.76748972574869789},{"h":0.01750520486011653,"x":0.1008230445557274,"t":"career opportunities. Therefore, they should be allowed to improve their lives outside the limitations","y":0.26017441844387545,"c":1,"w":0.78189300537109374},{"w":0.78395060221354163,"c":1,"h":0.017455556507806946,"x":0.10082305269490063,"y":0.27906976728267252,"t":"of their country of origin. For example, whilst in Spain residents in a hospital do not have hands-on"},{"x":0.10082304549467551,"y":0.29796511666730963,"c":1,"h":0.018895348053517669,"w":0.77572016398111987,"t":"experience due to safety measures, in other countries such as Argentina, residents actually practice"},{"x":0.10082303572946529,"y":0.31831395332878376,"w":0.72839508056640623,"h":0.017441860778592999,"c":1,"t":"their skills with patients. Besides, cultural exchanges have proven to increase efficiency, since"},{"t":"different nationalities mean different believes and the introduction of new methods.","c":1,"h":0.01869434069126874,"w":0.65240107218424481,"x":0.10076359073484667,"y":0.33452670161735076},{"t":"On the other hand, when professionals leave the country where they trained, countries are","c":1,"y":0.36336866907091436,"x":0.10082303951101675,"w":0.70370371500651041,"h":0.017445284570484998},{"c":1,"y":0.38221437010527215,"w":0.74485595703124996,"t":"damaged socially and economically. In countries where the government provides free education","x":0.100823050179737,"h":0.018948420197719362},{"t":"and healthcare, many people think that the population should compensate the country with their","c":1,"y":0.40110244701466469,"h":0.018839176748610575,"x":0.10076907873986765,"w":0.75112523396809894},{"t":"skills and abilities. Furthermore, as a study fo South African emigration has pointed out when","h":0.020615439532923663,"y":0.41962814749412125,"x":0.10074944561524499,"c":1,"w":0.73471059163411456},{"y":0.4404069765848676,"c":1,"x":0.10082304108730132,"t":"a protessional lease the country it results in the loss of 10 unskilled jobs. Therefore it affect the","w":0.74897120157877606,"h":0.017484660423826903},{"h":0.01744185965530165,"y":0.45930232581188402,"t":"economy and the community.","x":0.10082305170150946,"c":1,"w":0.23251027425130211},{"x":0.098765442422177233,"w":0.7654320780436199,"h":0.018951843989611583,"t":"Taking everything into account, it can be said that miving out from the country of training should","y":0.48546511666671655,"c":1},{"h":0.018902196760593237,"c":1,"t":"not be taken lightly, given the adverse effects on the population. However, I firmly believe that","x":0.10082305208454206,"w":0.73251027425130211,"y":0.50436046550085745},{"t":"someone's professional development should not depend on their country of origin and protessionals","y":0.52150006871929411,"w":0.780046895345052,"h":0.022037179225746328,"c":1,"x":0.10071882292678576},{"t":"should be allowed to look for better opportunities overseas.","x":0.10055283745531279,"w":0.46969202677408844,"h":0.02181150213989691,"y":0.5410430832336719,"c":1},{"w":0.034979422887166378,"c":1,"x":0.84773662595821253,"t":"135","y":0.86773255796252025,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"w":0.30613845825195307,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","h":0.033792529426278195,"x":0.66991094639740412,"y":0.95311055968589831,"c":1}],"h":3395}